    <div id="p-0135" num="0139" class="description-paragraph">Referring to Table 1, the separators including the acrylic copolymer including a specific structural unit along with the inorganic particles and the organic filler exhibited excellent moisture and withstand voltage characteristics, as a content of the organic filler was increased within a particular range, and particularly, exhibited a shrinkage rate of less than 10% at 150° C. and thus realized excellent heat resistance and adhesion characteristics.</div>
